sequenceDiagram
    title Login flow
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant B as Browser
    participant S as Server
    participant D as Database
    U->>B: Enter credentials
    B->>+S: POST /login
    S->>+D: SELECT user
    D-->>-S: row
    alt valid password
        S-->>B: 200 OK + cookie
    else invalid
        S--xB: 401 Unauthorized
    end
    deactivate S
    Note over B,S: TLS everywhere
    loop every 5 minutes
        B-)S: heartbeat
    end
    Note right of D: replicated
